# ── codebud-web environment ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local for dev; set in the hosting provider for prod.

# URL of the codebud-platform app (Get Started / login handoff target).
# Dev: http://localhost:3000   Prod: https://app.mycodebud.in
NEXT_PUBLIC_PLATFORM_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── SMTP ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Drives /api/contact, which backs the contact form and the newsletter signup.
# Both send FROM and TO info@mycodebud.in; the visitor's address goes in
# Reply-To, so the From stays a mailbox this domain is allowed to send as.
#
# SMTP_USER must be the info@mycodebud.in mailbox. SMTP_PASS is that mailbox's
# password or app password -- never commit it; set it in the host's secret store.
# Port 465 is implicit TLS, 587 is STARTTLS.
# SMTP_HOST is a PLACEHOLDER -- set it to whatever hosts the mycodebud.in
# mailbox (Zoho: smtp.zoho.in, Google Workspace: smtp.gmail.com, etc.).
SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=info@mycodebud.in
SMTP_PASS=
